        "address_string": "mx2ioxULTTF6gEzChrGopKSD4keZUeTVq3ZkbnxDQ9k13tXYVz6Ek"
      },
      "_note2": "addr32_hex and address_string are real values derived by dilithium-py (FIPS 204 §6.1). checksum4_hex 0bb414d9 confirmed by Node.js SHA-512 computation (audit-fixup-v2 L-4 closure, 2026-04-29)."
